{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hant","entities":{"2535477":{"renderings":[{"id":"5a789d60effba18c","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13894369"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"那一天，整日聽著寂寥的筆聲度過。其間，時不時也能聽到啾啾的鳴叫聲。他想，文鳥或許也是因寂寞才啼鳴的吧。然而走到廊簷一看，牠正在兩根棲木之間，忽而飛往那邊，忽而飛回這邊，來來回回，片刻不停。絲毫看不出有什麼不滿的樣子。","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"3550836":{"renderings":[{"id":"faebc506dfc39895","lang":"zh","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"4879138"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"这是什么的声音？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"10938373":{"renderings":[{"id":"6b8b03f13ca6b372","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13893623"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"「我唱歌時常會跑調呢。」「這種情況叫做音癡喔。」","direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}